    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62167" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάω</span></b>  (A) [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ],</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλέπω, οὐδέ κεν αὐτὸν
					αἰετὸς ὀξὺ λάων ἐσκέψατο</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				360
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γηθήσειε λάων</span> is probably 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ἰδών</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.344
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				769
			</span></i>); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάετε: σκοπεῖτε,
			βλέπετε</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cyr.
			</span></i></div>
